  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>C</mi></math> being the constant of integration. Then the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know,</p><p><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />Thus, <math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />i.e. <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo></math> which has the maximum value of&nbsp;<math><mn>&#8216;1&#8217;</mn></math></p>"
  }
